{"kind":"html","caption":"先计算总和：若总和为奇数，一定无法平分；示例 [1,5,11,5] 的总和为 22，因此只需寻找和为 11 的子集。动画用一维动态规划展示每个数字如何从右向左更新可达状态，倒序可以避免同一个数字在一轮中被重复使用。当目标状态 dp[11] 变为可达时，说明存在子集 [11]（也可取 [1,5,5]），其余元素自然组成另一个等和子集。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>分割等和子集可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.summary{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.badge{flex:1 1 100px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.badge strong{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px}\n.numbers{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n.number-card{min-width:38px;padding:4px 6px;text-align:center;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}\n.number-card.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.label{display:block;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.status{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;line-height:1.45;font-size:11px}\n.dp-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}\n.cell .index{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.cell .value{color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.cell.reachable{border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.reachable .value{color:#3794ff}\n.cell.focus{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.focus .index,.cell.focus .value{color:#fff}\n.cell.source{background:#252526;border-color:#3794ff}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.dot{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.dot.yes{border-color:#3794ff}.dot.now{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.result{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.subset{flex:1 1 140px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}\n.subset strong{color:#3794ff}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress>div{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>能否凑出总和的一半</h1>\n<section class=\"panel summary\">\n<div class=\"badge\">输入<strong>[1, 5, 11, 5]</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge\">总和<strong>22</strong></div>\n<div class=\"badge\">目标<strong>11</strong></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div>当前数字</div>\n<div class=\"numbers\" id=\"numbers\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">准备开始：只有和 0 默认可达。</div>\n<div class=\"dp-wrap\" id=\"dp\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot yes\"></i>可达</span><span><i class=\"dot now\"></i>本步</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\" id=\"resultPanel\">\n<div><strong>判定：</strong><span id=\"verdict\">等待推演</span></div>\n<div class=\"result\">\n<div class=\"subset\">A <strong class=\"mono\">[1,5,5]</strong> → 11</div>\n<div class=\"subset\">B <strong class=\"mono\">[11]</strong> → 11</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const nums = [1, 5, 11, 5];\n  const target = 11;\n  const numbersEl = document.getElementById('numbers');\n  const dpEl = document.getElementById('dp');\n  const statusEl = document.getElementById('status');\n  const verdictEl = document.getElementById('verdict');\n  const progressEl = document.getElementById('progress');\n\n  nums.forEach((n, i) => {\n    const el = document.createElement('div');\n    el.className = 'number-card';\n    el.innerHTML = `<span class=\"label\">${i}</span><span class=\"mono\">${n}</span>`;\n    numbersEl.appendChild(el);\n  });\n\n  for (let s = 0; s <= target; s++) {\n    const el = document.createElement('div');\n    el.className = 'cell';\n    el.innerHTML = `<span class=\"index\">${s}</span><span class=\"value\">×</span>`;\n    dpEl.appendChild(el);\n  }\n\n  const numberCards = [...numbersEl.children];\n  const cells = [...dpEl.children];\n  let dp = Array(target + 1).fill(false);\n  let actions = [];\n\n  function buildActions() {\n    actions = [{ type: 'init' }];\n    const work = Array(target + 1).fill(false);\n    work[0] = true;\n    nums.forEach((num, ni) => {\n      actions.push({ type: 'pick', ni, num });\n      for (let s = target; s >= num; s--) {\n        const source = s - num;\n        const can = work[source];\n        actions.push({ type: 'check', ni, num, s, source, can });\n        if (can && !work[s]) {\n          work[s] = true;\n          actions.push({ type: 'mark', ni, num, s, source });\n        }\n      }\n    });\n    actions.push({ type: 'done' });\n  }\n\n  function paint() {\n    cells.forEach((cell, i) => {\n      cell.className = 'cell' + (dp[i] ? ' reachable' : '');\n      cell.querySelector('.value').textContent = dp[i] ? '✓' : '×';\n    });\n  }\n\n  function clearCards() { numberCards.forEach(x => x.classList.remove('active')); }\n\n  function runAction(action, index) {\n    paint();\n    cells.forEach(x => x.classList.remove('focus', 'source'));\n    progressEl.style.width = `${Math.round((index + 1) / actions.length * 100)}%`;\n\n    if (action.type === 'init') {\n      dp = Array(target + 1).fill(false);\n      dp[0] = true;\n      clearCards();\n      verdictEl.textContent = '等待推演';\n      paint();\n      statusEl.innerHTML = '初始化：空子集可以组成和 <span class=\"mono\">0</span>，所以 <span class=\"mono\">dp[0] = true</span>。';\n    }\n    if (action.type === 'pick') {\n      clearCards();\n      numberCards[action.ni].classList.add('active');\n      statusEl.innerHTML = `取数字 <span class=\"mono\">${action.num}</span>。接下来从目标值向左检查，保证这个数字只使用一次。`;\n    }\n    if (action.type === 'check') {\n      cells[action.s].classList.add('focus');\n      cells[action.source].classList.add('source');\n      statusEl.innerHTML = `检查和 <span class=\"mono\">${action.s}</span>：查看此前的和 <span class=\"mono\">${action.source}</span> 是否可达，因为 <span class=\"mono\">${action.source} + ${action.num} = ${action.s}</span>。`;\n    }\n    if (action.type === 'mark') {\n      dp[action.s] = true;\n      paint();\n      cells[action.s].classList.add('focus');\n      cells[action.source].classList.add('source');\n      statusEl.innerHTML = `和 <span class=\"mono\">${action.source}</span> 已可达，加上 <span class=\"mono\">${action.num}</span> 后，和 <span class=\"mono\">${action.s}</span> 也变为可达。`;\n    }\n    if (action.type === 'done') {\n      clearCards();\n      cells[target].classList.add('focus');\n      verdictEl.innerHTML = '<span style=\"color:#3794ff\">true，可以分割</span>';\n      statusEl.innerHTML = `目标状态 <span class=\"mono\">dp[11]</span> 已可达。找到一个和为 <span class=\"mono\">11</span> 的子集后，其余元素的和也必然是 <span class=\"mono\">11</span>。`;\n    }\n  }\n\n  buildActions();\n  let step = 0;\n  function loop() {\n    runAction(actions[step], step);\n    step++;\n    if (step >= actions.length) {\n      step = 0;\n      setTimeout(loop, 3000);\n    } else {\n      setTimeout(loop, actions[step - 1].type === 'check' ? 1500 : 1900);\n    }\n  }\n  loop();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
